The kvio storage benchmark profiles and their original measurement harness were
contributed by Davidlohr Bueso and derived from kvspill:

    https://github.com/davidlohr/kvspill

They are incorporated into kvio with David's permission under the repository's
Apache-2.0 license.  The integration retains the workload intent while adding
model-derived object sizes, stricter raw-device checks, bounded regions,
structured artifacts, and restoration of temporary host tuning.
